commit 4819d11146519fae09051d2120a811a45d545a61

C03: the YouTube player keeps its own log, plays audio only and takes the small audio stream (MUSIC1567)

MUSIC1565 measured six of seven playbacks never reaching their first half second in mpv, in either of two resolved streams, while the same streams play by hand within seconds; the adapter offered no view of what the player did inside a tanda. mpv now writes its log under %LOCALAPPDATA%\BAXY\logs\youtube (the path travels in the receipt, never in the reply), plays audio only (--vid=no, so no GPU surface competes with the language model) and yt-dlp prefers the m4a audio stream (itag 140), smaller and quicker to start. Nothing else changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


